[I] A highly automated and intuitive digital audio workstation

[T] Zrythm is a digital audio workstation designed to be featureful and easy
[T] to use. It offers streamlined editing workflows with flexible tools,
[T] limitless automation capabilities, powerful mixing features, chord
[T] assistance and support for various plugin and file formats.

